    <!-- Service 2: AI Workflows -->
    <div class="svc-card r">
      <div class="svc-top">
        <div class="svc-num">02 / AUTONOMOUS WORKFLOWS</div>
        <div class="svc-icon-box">⚡</div>
      </div>
      <h3>AI Systems & Workflow Automation</h3>
      <p>Save 15+ hours weekly per team member. Custom n8n and Make.com pipelines that automate lead qualification, personalized outreach, CRM updates, and content distribution seamlessly.</p>
      
      <div style="margin-top: 1rem; padding: 0.65rem 0.9rem; background: rgba(255, 133, 51, 0.08); border-left: 2px solid var(--orange); border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #fff;">
        <strong style="color: var(--orange);">Proven Impact:</strong> 15+ hours automated weekly per team member with zero data loss.
      </div>

      <div class="svc-tags">
        <span class="svc-tag">n8n Automation</span>
        <span class="svc-tag">Make.com</span>
        <span class="svc-tag">LLM Agents</span>
        <span class="svc-tag">CRM Sync</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Service 3: Performance Marketing -->
    <div class="svc-card r">
      <div class="svc-top">
        <div class="svc-num">03 / PAID GROWTH</div>
        <div class="svc-icon-box">📊</div>
      </div>
      <h3>Meta Ads & Performance Marketing</h3>
      <p>Data-driven ad campaigns designed for positive ROAS. Precision targeting, creative split-testing, and funnel optimization that reduced client CAC by 30% while scaling volume.</p>
      
      <div style="margin-top: 1rem; padding: 0.65rem 0.9rem; background: rgba(255, 133, 51, 0.08); border-left: 2px solid var(--orange); border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #fff;">
        <strong style="color: var(--orange);">Proven Impact:</strong> 30% CAC reduction & 3.71x ROAS on consumer brand funnels.
      </div>

      <div class="svc-tags">
        <span class="svc-tag">Facebook & IG Ads</span>
        <span class="svc-tag">ROAS Scaling</span>
        <span class="svc-tag">CAC Reduction</span>
        <span class="svc-tag">Funnel CRO</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Service 4: Revenue Engines -->
    <div class="svc-card r">
      <div class="svc-top">
        <div class="svc-num">04 / REVENUE ENGINES</div>
        <div class="svc-icon-box">🚀</div>
      </div>
      <h3>Automated B2B Lead Generation</h3>
      <p>Predictable pipeline engineering. Automated multi-channel lead discovery, verification, AI enrichment, and personalized nurturing that continuously books qualified calls.</p>
      
      <div style="margin-top: 1rem; padding: 0.65rem 0.9rem; background: rgba(255, 133, 51, 0.08); border-left: 2px solid var(--orange); border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.8rem; color: #fff;">
        <strong style="color: var(--orange);">Proven Impact:</strong> &lt;60 second speed-to-lead response driving 2.4x booking rates.
